Comment: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:08.15,05EDMVJP,EDMV,0,0,0,,君がいた夏は
Comment: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:15.29,05EDMVJP,EDMV,0,0,0,,遠い夢の中
